ith conditions based on the hostname being in the group and the service status.\n\nI should also make sure that the YAML is properly formatted, with the correct indentation and no trailing spaces. Each task should be a dictionary under the tasks key.\n\nLet me double-check the modules and their parameters. For the systemd command, it\'s correct as \'systemctl list-unit-files --type=service\'. For the set_fact, I\'ll use the appropriate conditionals.\n\nI think that\'s all. Now, I\'ll write the YAML playbook accordingly.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Populate services facts\n  systemd:\n    list: true\n    service: true\n    command: list-unit-files\n    type: service\n  register: services_facts\n\n- name: Set the Active Server variable\n  set_fact:\n    active_server: "{{ ansible_hostname }}"\n  when:\n    - ansible_hostname in group_vars[\'rke2_servers_group_name\']\n    - (ansible_service_mgr is not None and\n       (ansible_service_mgr.status[\'rke2-server\'] is not None and\n       ansible_service_mgr.status[\'rke2-server\'] == \'running\'))\n  delegate_to: all\n  run_once: yes\n  vars:\n    cluster_group: rke2_cluster_group_name\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-13T11:05:16.752795264Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 13554178029, 'load_duration': 70549900, 'prompt_eval_count': 282, 'prompt_eval_duration': 79172904, 'eval_count': 694, 'eval_duration': 13402797626, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--e907329f-cd96-4452-ab7f-3d9fbbfbf884-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 282, 'output_tokens': 694, 'total_tokens': 976}
